  * D_8015FD7E -> sSunDepthTestX
    zeldaret/oot (same decomp, same ROM address); structure verified against
    upstream at 1.00

  * D_8015FD80 -> sSunDepthTestY
    zeldaret/oot (same decomp, same ROM address); structure verified against
